OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering showers soon clearing this
OL,7,Fevening. Becoming dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells overnight. Light winds to
OL,9,Fstart, becoming breezy toward the end
OL,10,Fof the night. Feeling chilly,
OL,11,Fespecially in rural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA dry but cloudy and breezy
OL,14,Fstart. Becoming increasingly windy as
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain spread eastward
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon, perhaps heavy
OL,17,Fat times in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
