OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and possible isolated
OL,7,Fshowers Friday. Dry start Saturday,
OL,8,Frain later. Mostly cloudy with
OL,9,Foccasional showers Sunday.
OL,10,FTemperatures trending a little above
OL,11,Faverage.
